<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0a0d12">
  <meta name="description" content="Graphic design and UI/UX work by Garba John: event flyers, certificates and branding, designed in Figma, Adobe Photoshop and Canva.">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://garbajohn.vercel.app/design">
  <title>Garba John | Graphic & UI/UX Design</title>
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Garba John | Graphic & UI/UX Design">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Event flyers, certificates and branding designed in Figma, Photoshop and Canva.">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://garbajohn.vercel.app/design">
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://garbajohn.vercel.app/images/design/og-design.jpg">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root { --bg:#0a0d12; --card:#11161d; --line:#29313c; --text:#f3f7ef; --muted:#9aa4b2; --acid:#bdff42; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-family: Manrope, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; }
    a { color: inherit; }
    a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--acid); outline-offset: 3px; }
    .wrap { margin: auto; padding: 0 16px; width: min(1100px, 100%); }
    header { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 22px 0; }
    .back { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; }
    .hero { padding: 56px 0 28px; }
    .eyebrow { color: var(--acid); font-family: "DM Mono", monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(34px, 6vw, 60px); line-height: 1.05; margin: 10px 0 16px; }
    .lead { color: var(--muted); font-size: 17px; max-width: 680px; }
    .chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 22px; }
    .chips span { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; padding: 6px 14px; }
    .grid { display: grid; gap: 24px; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); padding: 28px 0 56px; }
    figure { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; margin: 0; overflow: hidden; }
    figure.wide { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    figure img { display: block; height: auto; width: 100%; }
    figcaption { padding: 16px 18px 20px; }
    figcaption b { display: block; font-size: 16px; }
    figcaption span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
    footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; padding: 26px 0 40px; }
    footer a { color: var(--acid); }
    @media (max-width: 720px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .hero { padding-top: 36px; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header><div class="wrap"><a class="back" href="/">&larr; GARBA JOHN</a></div></header>
  <main class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">DESIGN</div>
      <h1>Graphic &amp; UI/UX design</h1>
      <p class="lead">Alongside software engineering, I design: event flyers, certificates and branding, and interface layouts. A selection of recent work is below.</p>
      <div class="chips"><span>Figma</span><span>Adobe Photoshop</span><span>Canva</span><span>UI/UX design</span><span>Branding</span><span>Print &amp; social media</span></div>
    </section>
    <section class="grid" aria-label="Design work">
      <figure class="wide">
        <img src="/images/design/crusade-flyer-gold.webp" alt="Event flyer for a three-day crusade, with a gold and blue colour scheme, theme text, dates, venue and contact details" loading="lazy" width="1672" height="941">
        <figcaption><b>Event flyer: 3-day crusade</b><span>Bread of Life Divine Covenant Ministry. Clear hierarchy for theme, dates, venue and enquiries.</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <img src="/images/design/crusade-flyer-blue.webp" alt="Alternative blue version of the crusade flyer with large headline text" loading="lazy" width="1672" height="941">
        <figcaption><b>Flyer variation</b><span>An alternative colourway and layout of the same campaign.</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <img src="/images/design/certificate-discipleship.png" alt="Certificate of completion for a discipleship class with a navy and gold border and ministry logo" loading="lazy" width="2000" height="1333">
        <figcaption><b>Certificate of completion</b><span>Print-ready certificate with a navy and gold border, seal and signature lines.</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <img src="/images/design/crown-avatar.webp" alt="Jewelled circular crown avatar on a black background" loading="lazy" width="735" height="1306">
        <figcaption><b>Crown avatar</b><span>AI-assisted artwork, edited and composed in Canva.</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer><div class="wrap">Need design or development work? <a href="mailto:garbajohn101@gmail.com">garbajohn101@gmail.com</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href="/cv">View CV</a></div></footer>
</body>
</html>
